<p>You bind light in a glyph on the floor. All enemies walking over the glyph will be hit by a blast that does <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100,<br>spellpower 100">33, 47, 58, 67, 75</acronym> physical damage and knocks them back.</p><p>The glyph is a hidden trap (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100,<br>spellpower 100">26, 37, 46, 53, 60</acronym> detection and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100,<br>spellpower 100">33, 47, 58, 67, 75</acronym> disarm power based on your Magic) and lasts for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>